This distinction is fundamental to the project.

Layer
Example
Job
Pydantic schema
WebhookCreate
Validate incoming JSON request data.
Pydantic response
WebhookResponse / WebhookCreateResponse
Control API response shape.
SQLAlchemy model
Webhook
Represent and persist database rows.
FastAPI dependency
get_current_user
Inject authenticated user.
SQLAlchemy Session
db
Perform database operations.
