30. Developer Mental Model — Remember This
AUTHENTICATION
JWT tells FastAPI WHO you are.

AUTHORIZATION
user_id filters tell FastAPI WHAT you are allowed to access.

PYDANTIC
Validates the shape of data coming into/out of the API.

SQLALCHEMY MODEL
Represents a database table in Python.

SESSION
Performs the actual database work.

POSTGRESQL
Stores the persistent data.

ROUTER
Defines HTTP endpoints and request/response behavior.

SERVICE
Contains reusable business/network logic.

ALEMBIC
Changes the database schema over time.

FRONTEND
Calls the API and renders the result.

WEBHOOK SECRET
Signs outbound requests so receivers can verify authenticity.

DELIVERY
Records what happened when HookRelay attempted an outbound request.

